A web crawler

The `Frontier` gives URLs to the `Fetcher`. The `Fetcher` downloads pages from
the `Web` and passes them to the `Parser`. The `Parser` adds new URLs to the
`Frontier` and stores text in the `Index`.
---
Frontier -> Fetcher: urls
Fetcher -> Web: download
Fetcher -> Parser: pages
Parser -> Frontier: new urls
Parser -> Index: text
